      "severity": "CONCERN",
      "title": "Operator feature requirement contradicts the implementation",
      "description": "The new caution states that the Operator will fail unless `rolling-updates` is enabled, but the inspected implementation does not enforce this requirement. `UpgradeLogicFactory.create()` selects an upgrade strategy solely from `UpdateSpec`, and both strategy implementations decide upgrades without invoking the newly gated CLI commands or checking feature configuration. Consequently, enabling the feature does not control these Operator update strategies.\n\nEither implement the intended Operator feature gate or revise the caution so it does not claim that ordinary Operator deployments require this preview feature.",
